msgctxt "96"
msgid ""
"You're not half bad. No wonder the Tojo Clan made you\r\n"
"one of their bosses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"I'm not with the Tojo Clan anymore, so you can stop calling me one of their "
"bosses."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Still, I'm surprised to see you wielding a katana."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"When it comes to slicing and dicing, you can't do any\r\n"
"better than a Japanese katana."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"I thought I'd see a lot of them when I came to Japan,\r\n"
"but there don't seem to be many around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "They're not all that easy to get a hold of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"I guess not... Well, it looks like I blew my chance to learn\r\n"
"about the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Did you join the Reapers just so you could learn about\r\n"
"the Tojo Clan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"That's right. I heard they were fighting the Tojo Clan.\r\n"
"Thought I could learn some cool shit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"And they say Kamurocho is the best place to get information,\r\n"
"so that's why I came here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "What were you going to do with the information?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"I wasn't trying to start any trouble. I was just interested\r\n"
" in the world of the Japanese underground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"I see. Well, come with me to the HLA for now. Maybe you\r\n"
"can learn a few things about the Tojo Clan there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"If your interest in the clan is just mere curiosity,\r\n"
"then that's the place for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Hey, that sounds great. I owe you one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Nippon is awesome, man. Look at that building..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "I wonder how many stories it is? Ichi, ni, san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Hey. What are you trying to accomplish here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"I'm looking at one of Kamurocho's famous landmarks, the\r\n"
"Millennium Tower..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Uh, can I help you with something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "You're the Reaper Lorentz, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "I sure am. And you're Kazuma Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Wait, how do you know my name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"I came here to learn about the Tojo Clan. You're their\r\n"
"Fourth Boss, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"You're just the guy I've been looking for. I was hoping I\r\n"
"could talk to somebody in the know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "What about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"I'm looking for information on the Tojo Clan only somebody like you\r\n"
"would know about, if you know what I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"I'm not in the business anymore. If you want inside\r\n"
"information, ask somebody else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"That's not gonna cut it. Chances like this don't come along\r\n"
"every day, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "If you don't wanna talk, I'll just have to make you!"
msgstr ""

